---
// Ill09FiveNumbers.astro
// Visual brief: The Five Numbers — Distinguishing NAV, Accounting Profit, Taxable Income, Distribution, Redemption Gain
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 09</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Five Financial Measurements</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-navy-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 rounded font-medium">Accounting vs Tax</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700">
          <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Measurement</th>
          <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">What it tells you</th>
          <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-right">Tax Consequence</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-navy-800">
        <tr>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">1. NAV</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Total marked-to-market economic valuation of your unit holding.</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-right font-mono">None (Unrealized)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-navy-800/30">
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">2. Fund Profit</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Accounting net income generated across portfolio trades.</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-right font-mono">Subject to tax filters</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-mono">3. Taxable Income</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Statutory income recognized under Act 2025 (deemed or actual).</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-right font-mono font-bold">Tax is levied here</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-navy-800/30">
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-mono">4. Distribution</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Actual cash transferred to investor bank account.</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-right font-mono">Cash flow ≠ Tax</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono">5. Redemption Gain</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Capital gain/loss realized upon exiting or surrendering AIF units.</td>
          <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-right font-mono font-bold">Capital gains tax on units</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">Five numbers can describe the same investment. They do not necessarily represent the same tax event.</p>
  </div>
</div>
